@page
@model PrivacyModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}
<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<p>At Dribble Kings, we respect your privacy and are committed to protecting it. Currently, we do not collect, store, or process any personal information from our users.</p>

<h2>Information Collection</h2>
<p>Dribble Kings does not collect any personal or analytical data from users at this time. This means no personal information, browsing data, or other user-specific information is gathered when you interact with our site.</p>

<h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
<p>If our data practices change in the future, we will update this Privacy Policy to reflect any new policies. Please review this page periodically to stay informed of any updates.</p>

<h2>Contact Us</h2>
<p>If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy, please feel free to reach out through our contact options on the website.</p>